{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/EOSteamPageGif_Players.gif?t=1745255811\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be the last bot sitting in head to head matches with 2-4 players.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience tense PvP matches with 2, 3 or 4 players. Start each round by picking a wire and setting a detonator. If another player triggers your detonator you'll get bonus cash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/EOSteamPageGif_Money.gif?t=1745255811\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Clear wires to get cash, the richest player at the end of the 3 rounds wins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The BombSlot device houses 4 wheels with 8 wires each. On your turn choose one of the three wheels to cut its front facing wire. Cutting a wire can earn you cash, abilities or, if your unlucky, detonate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/EOSteamPageGif_Abilities.gif?t=1745255811\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use a variety of abilities to gain an edge over chance.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scan</strong> - to narrow down which wires may be detonators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spin</strong>\u00a0- each wheel to a new random position (and maybe earn some bonus cash).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skip</strong> - your turn, sometimes its best to let another player cut a suspicious looking wire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reverse</strong> -  the turn order and send it right back to the previous bot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lock</strong> - to limit another players choice to just one wheel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>And more!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/EOSteamPageGif_Boom.gif?t=1745255811\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And more!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More features and mechanics are coming that have yet to be revealed. Stay tuned!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3674980?t=1745255811","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/0d720a76469d212ce6f89824349936cd2cdc256e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745255811","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/2c75491ca94b488a677a3e6f7e7a27c8be6da8f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745255811","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/2c75491ca94b488a677a3e6f7e7a27c8be6da8f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745255811","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/EOSteamPageGif_Discord.gif?t=1745255811\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674980/extras/EOSteamPageGif_Players.gif?t=1745255811\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be the last bot sitting in head to head matches with 2-4 players.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience tense PvP matches with 2, 3 or 4 players. Start each round by picking a wire and setting a detonator. If another player triggers y